  </h5>
  <h5 class='tw-text-primary-text tw-text-[2rem] tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-gap-[16px] tw-py-[16px]'>
    About the Kaddish End Date:
    <br>
    Kaddish is recited for eleven months from the date of passing. Even if the interment took place a number of dats
    after the death, the 11 months are stull counted from the date of passing. However, if the burial was postponed for
    two or more weeks after death, kaddish should be recited until the end of 11 months counting fron the date of the
    burial.
  </h5>
